              equals: invalid_request

  - id: "#authn-cid-didkey-missing-client-id"
    type: NegativeTest
    name: authn-cid-didkey-missing-client-id
    label: A did:key credential without a client_id claim is refused
    comment: >-
      The core authentication data model makes the client_id (client) claim REQUIRED in every
      authentication credential. The CID suite then requires sub, iss and client_id to
